   "id": "I109",
   "kind": "answer",
   "text": "Why is London considered one of the world’s preeminent cities? London is the capital of the UK, situated on the River Thames. It is the hub of a political, economic and cultural network that extends far beyond England’s shores. It remains the financial centre of Europe and a major centre of innovation and popular culture.",
