  {
   "id": "I110",
   "kind": "answer",
   "text": "Describe the importance of Birmingham during the Industrial Revolution. Birmingham was at the forefront of the Industrial Revolution. It produced worldwide advances in science, technology and economic development. The industrial steam engine, one of the most important inventions in British history, was invented in Birmingham.",
   "page": 5,
   "section": "answers",
   "topic": "",
   "context": "",
   "marker": "2.",
   "bullet": false,
   "bold": [
