   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "I111",
   "kind": "answer",
   "text": "What role did Harland and Wolff play in Belfast’s industrial history? Harland and Wolff was the world’s biggest and most productive shipyard in the early 20th century. It built the famous RMS Titanic and made Belfast a global centre of shipbuilding during the Industrial Revolution.",
   "page": 5,
   "section": "answers",
   "topic": "",
   "context": "",
   "marker": "3.",
   "bullet": false,
   "bold": [
